      <noscript>
      <div style="max-width:840px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 20px;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;line-height:1.55">

  <h1>Startup Summit Lisbon 2026</h1>
  <p><strong>September 17–18, 2026 · Beato Innovation District, Lisbon, Portugal</strong></p>
  <p>A founder-first European startup conference — targeting 2,000+ founders, investors and operators, with 150+ speakers planned, 200+ startup booths planned, 3 stages and 40+ countries represented.</p>

  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>Startup Summit is organised by the team behind StartUp Events, which has brought founder-focused conferences to London, Madrid, Berlin, and cities across Europe since 2019. Founded by Ricardo Pascual, the event is built for founders, investors, and operators who want actionable outcomes — not just inspiration.</p>

  <h2>Tickets</h2>
  <p>General Admission from €49, Founder Pass from €99, Startup Booth from €199, Investor Pass from €199, VIP from €249. All tickets include access to keynotes, panels, exhibition hall, and networking.</p>

